            "69013304": {
              "title": "",
              "desc": "· Each successful counter and subsequent trigger of a special stagger against the Boss's attacks grants <color=#FFAF2C>1,000 Performance Points</color>. During the <Term:2000003>Control Skill</Term>, each successful counter against the Boss's attacks grants <color=#FFAF2C>500 Performance Points</color>. Performing a <color=#FFAF2C>Shutdown</color> on the Boss's <color=#FFAF2C>Control Skill</color> grants <color=#FFAF2C>1,500 Performance Points</color>. Maximum obtainable Performance Points: 5,000."
            },
            "69014407": {
              "title": "69014407_Title",
              "desc": "When an Agent lands Shutdown on an enemy, the enemy's All-Attribute RES decreases by 10%, Agents with Attack specialty gain 20% bonus ATK, 25% bonus PEN Ratio, and their Ice and Ether CRIT DMG increases by 60%. \nUpon triggering a special stagger, the whole squad's Anomaly Proficiency increases by 40 pts and their Anomaly DMG increases by 30%."
