            "69014401": {
              "title": "Icy Raid",
              "desc": "· DMG dealt by Agents' <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack</color> and <color=#FFFFFF>Ultimate</color> <color=#2BAD00>increases by 30%</color>. When an Agent with Attack specialty hits an enemy, their attacks ignore <color=#2BAD00>20%</color> of the target's <color=#98EFF0>Ice RES</color>.\n· After an Agent uses an <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack</color>, their own <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color> <color=#2BAD00>increases by 30%</color> for 15s. Repeated triggers reset the duration."
            },
            "69014402": {
